            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"4-stratified-negation\">4 \u2014 Stratified negation</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>alice</code> is blocked \u2192 <code>safe(alice)</code> fails. <code>bob</code> is not blocked \u2192 <code>safe(bob)</code> succeeds.</span></span>"
