      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"6-coinduction\">6 \u2014 Coinduction</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Mark <code>test.stream</code> as coinductive so the engine treats the cycle\n<code>stream(X) :- stream(X)</code> as a successful (corecursive) proof.</span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Note</strong>: without <code>coinductive_anchors</code>, a pure positive self-cycle\nhas undefined termination in the current engine \u2014 always pass the\nanchor when reasoning about corecursive predicates.</span>\n</blockquote></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
